          "title": "QiuQiu",
          "subtitle": "Card Game",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "QiuQiu is a domino card game that involves tiles, matching, scoring. The game originated in China and has become popular worldwide."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia (game played throughout Indonesia); roots in Cantonese Pai Gow (China).\nTime Period: Early 1900s\nHistorical Development: Indonesian domino gambling game related to Cantonese Pai Gow; name Qiu/Kiu from Chinese word for 9.\nCultural Significance: Popular in Indonesia; also known as Kiu Kiu."
            }
          ]
        },
